<h1>Phase 7: Project Documentation Phase</h1>
<p style="font-size: 13pt; color: #4a5568;"><strong>ContentGen (BlogNest) Execution Manual</strong></p>

<h2>1. Starting the Backend Server</h2>
<pre><code># 1. Install dependencies
npm install

# 2. Seed initial demo data
npm run seed

# 3. Start development server
npm run dev

# 4. Start production server
npm start</code></pre>

<h2>2. Pre-Configured Demo Accounts</h2>
